| No CORS Config | A04 | MEDIUM | CORS | ✗ |
| No HTTPS Enforcement | A02 | MEDIUM | Encryption | ✗ |
| No Body Parser Limits | A03 | MEDIUM | Injection | ✗ |
| No XSS Protection | A03 | MEDIUM | XSS | ✗ |
| Hardcoded Config | General | MEDIUM | Config | ✗ |
| Missing Logging | A09 | MEDIUM | Monitoring | ✗ |
| Secrets in Repo | General | CRITICAL | Data | ✗ |

