# Security Implementation Guide

## Quick Start: Securing Your Express App

### Step 1: Install Security Packages
```bash
npm install helmet cors express-validator express-rate-limit jsonwebtoken bcryptjs uuid dotenv pino
```

### Step 2: Update .gitignore
```bash
echo ".env" >> .gitignore
echo ".env.*.local" >> .gitignore
echo "*.pem" >> .gitignore
```

### Step 3: Copy .env.example to .env
```bash
