|---|---|---|
| A01 Broken Access Control | 🔴 FAIL | No authentication, no authorization |
| A02 Cryptographic Failures | 🟡 WARN | HTTPS not enforced, secrets in code |
| A03 Injection | 🔴 FAIL | No input validation, SQL injection possible |
| A04 Insecure Design | 🟡 WARN | No security requirements |
| A05 Security Misconfiguration | 🔴 FAIL | No security headers, rate limiting |
| A06 Vulnerable Components | 🟡 WARN | Dependency versions not pinned |
| A07 Authentication Failures | 🔴 FAIL | No authentication implemented |
| A08 Soft-Token Issues | 🟡 WARN | No CSRF protection |
| A09 Logging Failures | 🟡 WARN | No logging configured |
| A10 SSRF | 🟡 WARN | Not applicable to current scope |

---

## Remediation Priority

**Phase 1 - CRITICAL (Must do first):**
1. Add JWT authentication
2. Add input validation
3. Add security headers
4. Add rate limiting

**Phase 2 - HIGH (Complete within 1 week):**
1. Add authorization checks
2. Add error handling
3. Add logging
4. Configure CORS

**Phase 3 - MEDIUM (Complete within 2 weeks):**
1. Setup HTTPS/TLS
2. Add environment variables
3. Add password hashing
4. Write security tests

