|--------|--------|-------|-------------|
| Authentication | 0% | 100% | ✅ Required |
| Input Validation | 0% | 100% | ✅ Required |
| HTTPS | Not enforced | Enforced | ✅ Enforced |
| Security Headers | 0/5 | 5/5 | ✅ Full Coverage |
