  Status: VULNERABLE
  Issues: No HTTPS enforcement
  Recommendations: Enforce HTTPS, use strong encryption keys

A03:2021 - Injection
  Status: VULNERABLE (if extended)
  Issues: No input validation
  Recommendations: Use express-validator, parameterized queries

A04:2021 - Insecure Design
  Status: VULNERABLE
  Issues: No security headers, no CORS
